{"v":1,"book":"Song","ch":6,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Where has your beloved gone, O you most beautiful among women? Where has your beloved turned, That we may seek him with you?","tok":[{"t":"Where has your "},{"t":"beloved","s":["H1730"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"gone","s":["H1980"],"a":[1]},{"t":", O you most beautiful among "},{"t":"women","s":["H0802"],"a":[4]},{"t":"? Where has your "},{"t":"beloved","s":["H1730"],"a":[7]},{"t":" turned, That we may "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1245"],"a":[8]},{"t":" him with you?"}]},{"n":2,"text":"My beloved has gone down to his garden, To the beds of spices, To feed in the gardens And gather lilies.","tok":[{"t":"My "},{"t":"beloved","s":["H1730"],"a":[0]},{"t":" has gone "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to his "},{"t":"garden","s":["H1588"],"a":[2]},{"t":", To the "},{"t":"beds","s":["H6170"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"spices","s":["H1314"],"a":[4]},{"t":", To "},{"t":"feed","s":["H7462"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"gardens","s":["H1588"],"a":[6]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"gather","s":["H3950"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"lilies","s":["H7799"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"I am my beloved’s, and my beloved is mine; He pastures his flock among the lilies.","tok":[{"t":"I am my "},{"t":"beloved’s","s":["H1730"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and my "},{"t":"beloved","s":["H1730"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is mine; He pastures his flock among the "},{"t":"lilies","s":["H7799"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"You are as beautiful, my love, as Tirzah, As lovely as Jerusalem, As terrible as an army with banners.","tok":[{"t":"You are as "},{"t":"beautiful","s":["H3303"],"a":[0]},{"t":", my "},{"t":"love","s":["H7474"],"a":[2]},{"t":", as "},{"t":"Tirzah","s":["H8656"],"a":[3]},{"t":", As "},{"t":"lovely","s":["H5000"],"a":[4]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[5]},{"t":", As "},{"t":"terrible","s":["H0366"],"a":[6]},{"t":" as an army with "},{"t":"banners","s":["H1713"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Turn your eyes away from me, For they overwhelm me. Your hair is like a flock of goats That repose on Gilead.","tok":[{"t":"Turn your "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"away","s":["H5437"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"me","s":["H5869"],"a":[1]},{"t":", For "},{"t":"they","s":["H1992"],"a":[3]},{"t":" overwhelm me. Your "},{"t":"hair","s":["H8181"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is like a "},{"t":"flock","s":["H5739"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"goats","s":["H5795"],"a":[7]},{"t":" That "},{"t":"repose","s":["H1570"],"a":[8]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"Gilead","s":["H1568"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Your teeth are like a flock of ewes That have come up from the washing, All of which have borne twins, And none of them is bereaved of her young.","tok":[{"t":"Your "},{"t":"teeth","s":["H8127"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are like a "},{"t":"flock","s":["H5739"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of ewes That have come "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"washing","s":["H7367"],"a":[5]},{"t":", All of which have borne "},{"t":"twins","s":["H8382"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And none of them is bereaved of her young."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Your cheeks are like a piece of pomegranate Behind your veil.","tok":[{"t":"Your cheeks are like a "},{"t":"piece","s":["H6400"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"pomegranate","s":["H7416"],"a":[1]},{"t":" Behind your veil."}]},{"n":8,"text":"There are sixty queens and eighty concubines And virgins without number.","tok":[{"t":"There are sixty "},{"t":"queens","s":["H4436"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"eighty","s":["H8084"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"concubines","s":["H6370"],"a":[4]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"virgins","s":["H5959"],"a":[5]},{"t":" without "},{"t":"number","s":["H4557"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"My dove, my perfect one, is but one; She is the only one of her mother; She is the choice one of her who bore her. The daughters saw her, and they called her blessed; The queens and the concubines, They also praised her.","tok":[{"t":"My "},{"t":"dove","s":["H3123"],"a":[2]},{"t":", my perfect one, is but "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; She is the only "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of her "},{"t":"mother","s":["H0517"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; She is the "},{"t":"choice","s":["H1249"],"a":[7]},{"t":" one of her who bore her. The "},{"t":"daughters","s":["H1323"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"saw","s":["H7200"],"a":[10]},{"t":" her, and they called her "},{"t":"blessed","s":["H0833"],"a":[12]},{"t":"; The "},{"t":"queens","s":["H4436"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"concubines","s":["H6370"],"a":[14]},{"t":", They also "},{"t":"praised","s":["H1984"],"a":[15]},{"t":" her."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Who is this woman who looks forth like the dawn, As beautiful as the moon, As clear as the sun, As terrible as an army with banners?","tok":[{"t":"Who is this woman who looks "},{"t":"forth","s":["H8259"],"a":[2]},{"t":" like the dawn, As beautiful as the "},{"t":"moon","s":["H3842"],"a":[6]},{"t":", As "},{"t":"clear","s":["H1249"],"a":[7]},{"t":" as the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H2535"],"a":[8]},{"t":", As "},{"t":"terrible","s":["H0366"],"a":[9]},{"t":" as an army with "},{"t":"banners","s":["H1713"],"a":[10]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":11,"text":"I went down to the orchard of nuts To see the freshness of the valley, To see whether the vine had budded, Whether the pomegranates were in bloom.","tok":[{"t":"I went "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"orchard","s":["H1594"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"nuts","s":["H0093"],"a":[2]},{"t":" To "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"freshness","s":["H0003"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"valley","s":["H5158"],"a":[6]},{"t":", To "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[7]},{"t":" whether the "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[9]},{"t":" had "},{"t":"budded","s":["H5132"],"a":[10]},{"t":", Whether the "},{"t":"pomegranates","s":["H7416"],"a":[11]},{"t":" were in bloom."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Before I was aware, My soul set me among the chariots of my noble people.","tok":[{"t":"Before I was "},{"t":"aware","s":["H3045"],"a":[1]},{"t":", My "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[2]},{"t":" set me among the "},{"t":"chariots","s":["H4818"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of my noble people."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Return, return, O Shulammite; Return, return, that we may gaze at you. Why should you gaze at the Shulammite, As upon the dance of two camps?","tok":[{"t":"Return","s":["H7725"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[1]},{"t":", O Shulammite; "},{"t":"Return","s":["H7725"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[4]},{"t":", that we may gaze at you. Why should you gaze at the Shulammite, As upon the dance of two camps?"}]}]}
